# A.N Resources — IDE Memory & Development Rules

- Official Brand Name: A.N Resources (NEVER use A.N Capital for the company name)
- Tagline: INVEST • TRADE • GROW
- Domain: alliancenetworkresources.com
- Contact Email: contact@alliancenetworkresources.com
- Tech Stack: Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, Tailwind CSS (CDN), Vanilla JS, Three.js WebGL
- Color Palette: Gold (#d4af37, #f2ca50), Dark Obsidian (#111111, #131313)
- Fonts: Libre Caslon Text (Headlines), Manrope (Body)
- Logo Asset: assets/img/logo.png?v=2
- Global Rule: Every project MUST have a `MEMORY.md` file in the project root documenting project identity, architecture, design tokens, sitemap, and deployment procedures.

